    "attention": "4 identical GQA FlashAttention-2 layers in every arm (pre-norm in the mamba-b3, xlstm, mamba3-pd and native-pd arms, which normalize nothing at their mixer input; post-norm in gdn and the three kda arms, which L2-normalize q/k and gate a normalized output and so are invariant to the input scale; the block type moves no parameter and no measurable throughput)",
    "mamba-b3": "12 faithful Mamba-3 SISO layers (expand=2 32x64, dynamic A, post-BCNorm bias, D skip, norm-before-gate, pre-norm shell) with rotation block size 3 over half of d_state 192 and official_fast SSD; the rotation timescale is group-shared rather than per-head, the one deliberate deviation, which keeps B/C one group wide and the scan on GQA",
    "xlstm": "10 mLSTM + 2 sLSTM layers in [m,m,m,a,m,m,s,a] x 2, pre-norm shell, mLSTM chunk 128",
    "mamba3-pd": "12 Mamba-3-improved native SISO PD-SSM layers, pre-norm shell, head-wise gated output RMSNorm (renamed from mamba3-siso-pd; the completed 24-cell wave logged the old name and ran without the output norm)",
    "native-pd": "12 published native Flash PD-SSM layers, pre-norm shell, head-wise gated output RMSNorm added (the published block normalizes nothing; the completed 24-cell wave ran without it)",
    "gdn": "12 frozen measured GatedDeltaNet2 layers",
    "kda": "12 shipped Kimi Delta Attention layers, plain SiLU short convolutions",
    "kda-hh-r2": "12 Kimi Delta Attention layers with 2 Householder factors and negative eigenvalues",
    "kda-gconv": "12 Kimi Delta Attention layers with LIV-style depthwise-gated short convolutions"
  },
